1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
People live through meaningful and difficult moments inside digital systems.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:12,000
But when the moment gets hard, Scripture is usually somewhere else.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Scripture Everywhere AI is one shared context engine.

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Each environment connects to the same intelligence, safety, and delivery system.

5
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Heart rate reaches 170 and effort exceeds 85 percent. The system detects the wall without interrupting.

6
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:55,000
Local consent, crisis, privacy, and cooldown checks wait for a safe recovery window.

7
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:10,000
A quiet vibration arrives. The runner raises their wrist, and only then does Scripture appear.

8
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:20,000
Blocked events never reach sponsor APIs.

9
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:34,000
Gloo OAuth2 and Completions V2 return need, bounded theme, tone, and safety.

10
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:46,000
The theme resolves to a canonical USFM passage identifier.

11
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:58,000
YouVersion returns the passage and Bible attribution; delivery policy selects timing and privacy.

12
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:10,000
Explicit opt-in is required, and crisis signals route to human support.

13
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:22,000
Sensitive social moments never auto-post. The system does not diagnose or claim divine certainty.

14
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:34,000
The same brain supports wearables, gaming, IDEs, social communities, and creators.

15
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:46,000
Only the connector and native delivery surface change.

16
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:54,000
Strict responses report which sponsor calls actually executed. Demo and live evidence stay separate.

17
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:59,000
Try o-yutaka.github.io/popopo. The right word, inside the moment.
